@prefix bs:   <http://example.org/battlespace#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# =============================================================================
#  AFSIM alignment
#
#  Every type string AFSIM can emit (platforms.type, events.weapon_type,
#  weapon_inventory.weapon_type) is an individual here, asserted to be an
#  instance of the ontology class it denotes. Everything else - superclasses,
#  categories, guidance / warhead / intended-target facets - follows from the
#  class axioms in battlespace.ttl by OWL-RL reasoning.
#
#  To align a new AFSIM type: add one entry naming its class. Aliases used by
#  different federates / model libraries get one entry each.
#  data/build_orbat_ttl.py checks every string the simulation emits is here.
# =============================================================================

